{"id": "providence-oasis-invoices", "title": "Family shelter billed the City for repairs prosecutors say never happened", "seconds": 133.3, "voice": "elevenlabs:OtHu0lbpdNTqJVqaxDtR", "narrator": "Maven", "tempo": 1.2, "made": "2026-11-24", "key": "13ffb54a68366ec5", "words": 404, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[0]"], "text": "Providence Foundation runs the Oasis, a shelter for families, using a City grant.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.56, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "The Oasis", "sub": "a family shelter run by Providence Foundation, on a City grant"}, "wt": [0.33, 0.45, 0.99, 1.22, 1.37, 2.17, 2.23, 2.5, 2.65, 3.38, 3.63, 3.71, 3.92]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[0]", "suspicious[0]"], "text": "In the summer of 2022, a manager there approved work at the shelter.", "t0": 4.68, "t1": 8.61, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Capital improvements", "sub": "June 24 to Sept 5, 2022", "kicker": "paint and lock work"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.23, 0.42, 0.5, 0.77, 1.6, 1.85, 2.23, 2.45, 2.91, 3.11, 3.22, 3.32]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[0]", "suspicious[0]"], "text": "A paint job, and taking deadbolts off the doors. How much was approved?", "t0": 8.73, "t1": 13.45, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Capital improvements", "sub": "June 24 to Sept 5, 2022", "kicker": "paint and lock work"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.34, 0.77, 1.16, 1.43, 1.82, 1.94, 2.06, 2.82, 3.76, 3.96, 4.12]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["established[1]", "suspicious[0]", "amount"], "text": "Over 115,000 dollars.", "t0": 13.45, "t1": 16.4, "shot": "b2", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$115,000", "label": "approved for repairs", "sub": "prosecutors say the work was never done"}, "emph": ["Over"], "wt": [0.04, 0.8, 1.03, 1.33, 1.85, 2.34]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[0]", "notEstablished[0]"], "text": "Prosecutors say that work never happened. Two former staffers are charged.", "t0": 16.92, "t1": 20.68, "shot": "b3", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "A charge is an allegation, not a conviction."}, "wt": [0.0, 0.53, 0.67, 0.88, 1.14, 1.41, 1.96, 2.4, 2.68, 3.11, 3.23]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[0]", "notEstablished[0]"], "text": "A charge is an allegation, not a conviction.", "t0": 20.8, "t1": 23.14, "shot": "b3x", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "A charge is an allegation, not a conviction."}, "wt": [0.02, 0.3, 0.61, 0.68, 0.77, 1.55, 1.69, 1.77]}, {"scene": "charge", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[0]", "story[3]"], "text": "First, the charges.", "t0": 23.36, "t1": 24.25, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "Complaints filed December 31, 2025", "sub": "Kenisha Roach and Robert Lacy Jr."}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.28]}, {"scene": "charge", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[0]", "story[3]"], "text": "On December 31, 2025, the District Attorney filed felony complaints against Kenisha Roach and Robert Lacy.", "t0": 24.37, "t1": 30.64, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "Complaints filed December 31, 2025", "sub": "Kenisha Roach and Robert Lacy Jr."}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.44, 1.16, 1.37, 2.35, 2.43, 2.7, 3.04, 3.31, 3.64, 4.1, 4.38, 4.8, 5.2, 5.45, 5.8]}, {"scene": "charge", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[0]"], "text": "At arraignment, both pleaded not guilty. Both deny it.", "t0": 30.76, "t1": 33.68, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "Not guilty pleas", "sub": "both deny the allegations"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.71, 0.91, 1.25, 1.46, 1.89, 2.33, 2.64]}, {"scene": "charge", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what", "story[1]"], "text": "Here's what prosecutors allege. Roach ran operations at the shelter.", "t0": 33.8, "t1": 37.55, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "contract", "name": "Robert Lacy Jr.", "sub": "sent invoices"}, {"art": "magnifier", "name": "Kenisha Roach", "sub": "approved them"}, {"art": "money", "name": "Providence", "sub": "paid with City money"}], "kicker": "What prosecutors allege"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.23, 0.38, 0.92, 1.56, 2.18, 2.38, 2.89, 2.97, 3.12]}, {"scene": "charge", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what", "story[1]"], "text": "Lacy was a coworker, not a licensed contractor.", "t0": 37.67, "t1": 40.25, "shot": "b6x", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "contract", "name": "Robert Lacy Jr.", "sub": "sent invoices"}, {"art": "magnifier", "name": "Kenisha Roach", "sub": "approved them"}, {"art": "money", "name": "Providence", "sub": "paid with City money"}], "kicker": "What prosecutors allege"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.21, 0.34, 0.43, 1.29, 1.47, 1.55, 1.95]}, {"scene": "charge", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what", "story[1]"], "text": "He sent bills, she approved them, and Providence paid him with City money.", "t0": 40.37, "t1": 44.11, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "contract", "name": "Robert Lacy Jr.", "sub": "sent invoices"}, {"art": "magnifier", "name": "Kenisha Roach", "sub": "approved them"}, {"art": "money", "name": "Providence", "sub": "paid with City money"}], "kicker": "What prosecutors allege"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.3, 0.53, 1.03, 1.17, 1.52, 2.08, 2.17, 2.64, 2.83, 2.94, 3.05, 3.32]}, {"scene": "charge", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "suspicious[1].what"], "text": "Then, they say, he sent her thousands of dollars back.", "t0": 44.23, "t1": 46.84, "shot": "b7", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "contract", "name": "Robert Lacy Jr.", "sub": "kept the payments"}, {"art": "money", "name": "Kickbacks", "sub": "“thousands of dollars”"}, {"art": "magnifier", "name": "Kenisha Roach", "sub": "the approver"}], "kicker": "What prosecutors allege"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.33, 0.84, 1.03, 1.18, 1.37, 1.69, 1.78, 2.21]}, {"scene": "settle", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "In May 2024, the City Attorney, the City's lawyer,", "t0": 47.06, "t1": 50.08, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "cityhall", "label": "The City Attorney", "sub": "suspended Providence in May 2024"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.08, 0.22, 0.48, 1.26, 1.37, 1.62, 2.2, 2.3, 2.63]}, {"scene": "settle", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "blocked Providence from new City deals and moved to ban it.", "t0": 50.08, "t1": 53.38, "shot": "b9x", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "cityhall", "label": "The City Attorney", "sub": "suspended Providence in May 2024"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.61, 1.06, 1.2, 1.35, 1.64, 2.11, 2.4, 2.61, 2.77, 3.01]}, {"scene": "settle", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[2]"], "text": "In August 2025, the two sides settled. How much did Providence agree to pay?", "t0": 53.5, "t1": 57.71, "shot": "b10", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "question", "label": "The settlement", "sub": "August 26, 2025"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.43, 0.63, 1.23, 1.37, 1.52, 1.84, 2.43, 2.77, 2.97, 3.1, 3.5, 3.69, 3.8]}, {"scene": "settle", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["story[2]"], "text": "1 million dollars.", "t0": 57.71, "t1": 59.33, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$1 million", "label": "settlement with the City", "sub": "August 26, 2025"}, "emph": ["1"], "wt": [0.04, 0.64, 1.05]}, {"scene": "settle", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["story[2]", "established[2]", "suspicious[2].what"], "text": "Nearly half went to workers denied holiday pay.", "t0": 59.85, "t1": 62.3, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "Where the $1 million goes", "rows": [["Holiday pay owed to workers", "$480,724.25"], ["Back to the City, fraudulent invoices", "$105,000"], ["Over five years, for the prior leadership’s accounting failures", "$414,275.75"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.33, 0.68, 0.83, 0.96, 1.3, 1.64, 2.05]}, {"scene": "settle", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["story[2]", "established[2]", "suspicious[2].what"], "text": "Then a sum over five years, for past accounting failures.", "t0": 62.42, "t1": 65.11, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "Where the $1 million goes", "rows": [["Holiday pay owed to workers", "$480,724.25"], ["Back to the City, fraudulent invoices", "$105,000"], ["Over five years, for the prior leadership’s accounting failures", "$414,275.75"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.2, 0.39, 0.62, 0.94, 1.37, 1.48, 1.79, 2.2]}, {"scene": "settle", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["story[2]", "established[2]", "suspicious[2].what"], "text": "And 105,000 dollars to repay the City for fraudulent invoices.", "t0": 65.23, "t1": 68.82, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "Where the $1 million goes", "rows": [["Holiday pay owed to workers", "$480,724.25"], ["Back to the City, fraudulent invoices", "$105,000"], ["Over five years, for the prior leadership’s accounting failures", "$414,275.75"]]}, "emph": ["105,000"], "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.26, 0.49, 0.74, 1.08, 1.42, 1.56, 1.87, 2.01, 2.22, 2.42, 2.91]}, {"scene": "settle", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[2]", "suspicious[2]"], "text": "Providence signed an admission: under its old managers, there was willful misconduct.", "t0": 68.94, "t1": 73.1, "shot": "b13x", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "conduct under prior management constituted willful misconduct"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.38, 0.58, 0.67, 1.51, 1.67, 1.85, 2.01, 2.78, 2.92, 3.07, 3.42]}, {"scene": "settle", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["notEstablished[1]"], "text": "One caution. The 105,000 and the 115,000 come from separate cases.", "t0": 73.22, "t1": 79.03, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["repaid in the settlement", "$105,000"], "b": ["in the criminal case", "$115,000"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.82, 1.25, 1.38, 1.6, 1.87, 2.35, 2.57, 2.65, 2.78, 3.02, 3.54, 4.11, 4.52, 4.73, 5.18]}, {"scene": "settle", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["notEstablished[1]"], "text": "They may not be the same bills, so don't add them up.", "t0": 79.15, "t1": 81.39, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["repaid in the settlement", "$105,000"], "b": ["in the criminal case", "$115,000"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.06, 0.19, 0.34, 0.46, 0.58, 0.77, 1.34, 1.46, 1.66, 1.78, 1.96]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[4]"], "text": "Now the leads. The first: City money checkers had flagged Providence. Not once, but two years in a row.", "t0": 81.61, "t1": 87.15, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "magnifier", "label": "Fiscal monitoring", "kicker": "The first lead", "sub": "FY2021-22 and FY2022-23"}, "emph": ["two years in a row"], "wt": [0.09, 0.15, 0.31, 0.84, 1.04, 1.61, 1.92, 2.17, 2.51, 2.64, 2.93, 3.68, 3.89, 4.41, 4.57, 4.72, 4.96, 5.04, 5.16]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3].what", "established[4]"], "text": "In the budget years 2021-22 and 2022-23, its billing didn't meet City standards.", "t0": 87.27, "t1": 93.06, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "magnifier", "label": "Out of conformance", "kicker": "The first lead", "sub": "invoices lacking support"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.06, 0.14, 0.41, 0.61, 0.88, 1.31, 1.47, 1.92, 2.2, 2.41, 2.84, 3.0, 3.94, 4.08, 4.4, 4.61, 4.83, 5.1]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["established[7]", "notEstablished", "next"], "text": "Its 2021 to 2024 tax returns say a federal audit was done. The federal file has none.", "t0": 93.18, "t1": 99.31, "shot": "b17a", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["tax returns, 2021 to 2024", "single audit done"], "b": ["federal audit clearinghouse", "no audit since 2016"]}, "emph": ["has none"], "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.37, 0.88, 1.08, 1.29, 1.74, 2.05, 2.56, 2.89, 2.96, 3.25, 3.56, 3.71, 4.19, 4.82, 5.12, 5.44, 5.67]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[5]", "established[3]"], "text": "The second lead: the City kept paying. Why?", "t0": 99.53, "t1": 102.28, "shot": "b18", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "money", "label": "Still funded", "kicker": "The second lead"}, "wt": [0.01, 0.06, 0.36, 0.82, 1.09, 1.34, 1.57, 2.25]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[5]", "established[3]"], "text": "The settlement let Providence keep doing City-funded work, and ended the ban case.", "t0": 102.28, "t1": 106.0, "shot": "b18x", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "money", "label": "Still funded", "kicker": "The second lead"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.17, 0.52, 0.71, 1.11, 1.31, 1.53, 2.07, 2.49, 2.6, 2.89, 3.01, 3.27]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["established[5]"], "text": "City payments: 5.43 million dollars in 2025.", "t0": 106.12, "t1": 109.99, "shot": "b19", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "City payments to Providence", "rows": [["FY2025", "$5.43M"], ["FY2026", "$4.57M"], ["FY2027, to early November", "$1.89M"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.25, 0.85, 1.38, 1.67, 1.94, 2.05, 2.44, 2.76, 2.84, 3.11]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]", "notEstablished[3]"], "text": "Not shown: that Roach or Lacy broke any law. The case hasn't gone to trial.", "t0": 110.21, "t1": 114.9, "shot": "b20", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["That Roach or Lacy committed a crime", "Any wrongdoing by current leaders"]}, "wt": [0.15, 0.28, 0.85, 1.11, 1.46, 1.66, 2.12, 2.46, 2.75, 3.21, 3.4, 3.6, 3.87, 4.07, 4.22]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[6]", "notEstablished[4]", "established[8]", "established[9]"], "text": "In court, both waived the hearing time limit on February 18, 2026. No plea has changed.", "t0": 115.02, "t1": 120.63, "shot": "b21a", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "The court registers", "sub": "hearings continue to 2026-11-03; no plea change"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.65, 0.89, 1.08, 1.17, 1.44, 1.64, 1.91, 2.04, 2.44, 3.03, 3.24, 4.13, 4.59, 4.85, 5.06]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "settle", "ref": ["next[1]", "next[0]"], "text": "What would settle it? The shelter's invoice records from summer 2022.", "t0": 120.75, "t1": 124.35, "shot": "b21", "visual": {"type": "settle", "cards": [{"who": "", "what": "The May 6, 2024 counts, against the $105,000"}, {"who": "", "what": "The shelter’s invoice backup, June to September 2022"}], "focus": 1}, "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.25, 0.58, 0.85, 1.23, 1.58, 1.97, 2.29, 2.44, 2.7, 2.97]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "status", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Two former staffers pleaded not guilty. Providence settled for 1 million dollars, and it's still funded.", "t0": 124.47, "t1": 130.14, "shot": "b22", "visual": {"type": "status"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.52, 0.97, 1.27, 1.52, 2.08, 2.97, 3.23, 3.38, 3.57, 3.86, 4.7, 4.82, 4.97, 5.2]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "end", "ref": ["end"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 130.26, "t1": 132.39, "shot": "b23", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.24, 0.59, 0.77, 1.04, 1.14, 1.25, 1.51, 1.78]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "The question", "charge": "The charges", "settle": "The settlement", "lead1": "Lead 1 · flagged twice", "lead2": "Lead 2 · still paid", "close": "Where it stands"}, "look": "flow", "hook": "document"}